OL,5,G1900 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FReality series following
OL,7,     Fhigh-speed police intercept units.
OL,8,     FThe interceptors assemble in
OL,9,     Fpursuit of a BMW with no
OL,10,     Finsurance, no tax and a suspected
OL,11,     Fbanned driver behind the wheel.
OL,12,G2000 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FRon and Spence race to a scene of
OL,14,     Fan alleged knife attack.
OL,15,G2100 Trauma Room One
OL,16,     FA patient is sped into theatre
OL,17,     Fafter a devastating stroke. Lorna
OL,18,     Fis rushed in for emergency surgery
OL,19,     Fafter breaking her back. A
OL,20,     Fconsultant neurosurgeon must act
OL,21,     Fquickly to avoid paralysis. (Ep5)
