OL,5,G0000 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FAfter being run over by a car, Sue
OL,7,     Farrives with spinal and head
OL,8,     Finjuries. Ethan starts to show
OL,9,     Fsigns of severe memory loss after
OL,10,     Fbanging his head at the skate
OL,11,     Fpark.
OL,12,G0100 #Text Me When You Get Home
OL,13,     FIn 2006, Elizabeth Shoaf, age 14,
OL,14,     Fwas abducted near her rural home
OL,15,     Fin South Carolina. The teenager
OL,16,     Fwas missing for over a week when a
OL,17,     Ftext message came through that
OL,18,     Foffered hope.
