OL,5,G0155 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Adil Sheraz treats a bus driver
OL,7,     Fwith over 100 lipomas, Dr Toby
OL,8,     FNelson tries to help a 23-year-old
OL,9,     Fwho's covered in keloids, plus a
OL,10,     Ftreat of a cyst for Dr Emma
OL,11,     FMcMullen.
OL,12,G0245 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,13,     FDr Chris Ferdinand administers a
OL,14,     Fsteroid injection into Martyn's
OL,15,     Fknee, but Martyn has turn and
OL,16,     Fpasses out. Dr Aireen Razak meets
OL,17,     FPaul, who's struggling to shake a
OL,18,     Fchest infection.
